	"#str_delta2b_erikson_pda_title"	"維修主管"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_1_email_from"	"Elliot Swann"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_1_email_subject"	"調查報告"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_1_email_text"	"McNeil 女士：\n\n我已收到您要求調查火星上各項活動的正式申請。依董事會要求，我即將動身前往調查您的指控。針對 Dr. Malcolm Betruger 的指控，我們非常慎重看待。如您可能已經知道的，UAC 的政策是不對媒體基於謠言或傳聞所提出的問題或說法作出回應或評論。我受託向您說明，您不得與我們法務部門以外的任何人討論此事。\n\n謝謝，\nElliot Swann\nUAC 執行顧問"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_1_email_to"	"Liz McNeil"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_2_email_from"	"Michael Abrams"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_2_email_subject"	"儲藏室密碼更改"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_2_email_text"	"Delta 第 2 層全體人員：\n\n為了將補給需求的錯誤降到最低，我正在更換所有保全儲藏區的存取密碼。我們必須持續對儲藏的所有庫存保持嚴格紀錄。請將您紀錄中第 07 號儲藏區的新密碼更新為：7 2 5。\n\n謝謝，\nMike Abrams\nDelta 保全，主管"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_2_email_to"	"Liz McNeil"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_3_email_from"	"Michael Abrams"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_3_email_subject"	"第 3 級權限密碼更改"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_3_email_text"	"Delta 第 2 層全體人員：\n\n因為六個月一次的輪換，第 3 級存取密碼已經更改。新密碼是 463\n\n謝謝，\nMike Abrams\nDelta 保全，主管"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_email_3_email_to"	"Liz McNeil"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_pda_fullname"	"Elizabeth A. McNeil"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_pda_name"	"Elizabeth McNeil"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_pda_post"	"Delta 實驗室，第 2 層"
	"#str_delta2b_mcneil_pda_title"	"研究主任"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_email_1_email_from"	"Thomas Franks"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_email_1_email_subject"	"儲物櫃更新"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_email_1_email_text"	"Jacob，\n我們最近更改了靜滯傳送控制台旁儲物櫃的密碼，改成：3 7 1。請務必把這點註記在當地保全小組的保全報告上。\n\n謝謝，\nThomas Franks\nDelta 保全，職員"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_email_1_email_to"	"Jacob Stemmons"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_email_2_email_from"	"維修部"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_email_2_email_subject"	"RE: 停電了！！"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_email_2_email_text"	"Stemmons 先生：\n我們已知悉您那一區的電力問題。目前我們正在處理整個 Delta 綜合設施內的多處電力問題。若您能檢查 Maint-04 的一些斷路器箱，確認是否只是斷路器的問題，將會大有幫助。請向服務台提交報告，我們會盡快派人到您的部門。\n\n謝謝，\n維修處\n\n----原始郵件----\n寄出：11-13-2145\n這該死的電力整個星期都在標本傳送區忽高忽低。這種狀況讓工作變得極度令人沮喪！可以請你們派人下來查看狀況嗎？\n\n謝謝，\nJacob Stemmons\n\n"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_email_2_email_to"	"Jacob Stemmons"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_pda_fullname"	"Jacob L. Stemmons"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_pda_name"	"Jacob Stemmons"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_pda_post"	"標本分析，第 2 層"
	"#str_delta2b_stemmons_pda_title"	"分析主管"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_audio_1_audio_info"	"製作人：Frank Cerano\n日期：09-19-2145\n開放修訂：否\n設為封存：是"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_audio_1_audio_name"	"個人語音日誌"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_email_1_email_from"	"Delta 管制中心"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_email_1_email_subject"	"需要立即醫療協助"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_email_1_email_text"	"Dr. Cerano，\n\n最近 Delta 科學團隊成員通報了嚴重的非理性行為與失眠案例。他們認為這些問題與近期的傳送實驗直接相關。請盡快到 Delta 第 3 層報到，協助處理醫療需求。\n\n謝謝\n"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_email_1_email_to"	"Frank Cerano"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_email_2_email_from"	"Delta 管制中心"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_email_2_email_subject"	"請求協助"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_email_2_email_text"	"Dr Cerano，\n\n我們目前無法處理您為 Delta 第 3 層增派醫療人員的申請。如您所知，醫療人員在過去兩週內遭遇嚴重人力短缺，無法再承擔額外工作量。D3-1 儲藏室內有多餘的醫療包，位於下層終端辦公室對面。317 號儲物櫃的密碼是 841。\n\nDelta 管制中心\n"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_email_2_email_to"	"Frank Cerano"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_pda_fullname"	"Frank Z. Cerano, Ph.D"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_pda_name"	"Frank Cerano"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_pda_post"	"Delta 實驗室，第 3 層"
	"#str_delta3_cerano_pda_title"	"醫生"
	"#str_delta3_lee_audio_1_audio_info"	"製作人：Han Lee\n日期：10-16-2145\n開放修訂：是\n設為封存：是"
	"#str_delta3_lee_audio_1_audio_name"	"探險隊報告"
	"#str_delta3_lee_audio_2_audio_info"	"製作人：Han Lee\n日期：10-20-2145\n開放修訂：否\n設為封存：是"
	"#str_delta3_lee_audio_2_audio_name"	"失蹤的 BFG"
	"#str_delta3_lee_email_1_email_from"	"Delta 保全"
	"#str_delta3_lee_email_1_email_subject"	"保全小組通知"
	"#str_delta3_lee_email_1_email_text"	"Han，\n\n由於上週的事件，Delta 保全小組將把額外補給品存放在第一傳送艙附近的 386 與 387 號儲物櫃。裝備一到，我們會立刻將存取密碼更新為 836。\n\n謝謝，\nThomas Palena\nDelta 保全職員"
	"#str_delta3_lee_email_1_email_to"	"Han Lee"
	"#str_delta3_lee_pda_fullname"	"Han M. Lee"
	"#str_delta3_lee_pda_name"	"Han Lee"
	"#str_delta3_lee_pda_post"	"Delta 實驗室，第 3 層"
	"#str_delta3_lee_pda_title"	"行政助理"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_audio_1_audio_info"	"製作人：Marten Shultz\n日期：08-07-2145\n開放修訂：否\n設為封存：是"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_audio_1_audio_name"	"個人語音日誌"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_email_1_email_from"	"Frank Cerano"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_email_1_email_subject"	"傳送轉移"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_email_1_email_text"	"Marten，\n我們的系統只能累積足夠的電荷讓傳送門開啟大約 10 到 15 秒。足夠讓一個小組通過，但不夠把部分較重的設備送進去。你知道要怎麼把穩定器的額外電力導入轉換器嗎？我認為如果能把保持場提高 13%，就能達到完整傳送功率，讓力場開啟更久。\n\n你能給的任何協助我都會非常感激。\n\n謝謝，\nFrank Cerano"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_email_1_email_to"	"Marten Shultz"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_pda_fullname"	"Marten R. Shultz, Ph.D"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_pda_name"	"Marten Shultz"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_pda_post"	"Delta 實驗室，第 3 層"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_pda_security"	"第 3 層控制站"
	"#str_delta3_shultz_pda_title"	"醫生"
	"#str_delta4_gilbert_email_1_email_from"	"Paul Downing"
	"#str_delta4_gilbert_email_1_email_subject"	"彈藥櫃"
	"#str_delta4_gilbert_email_1_email_text"	"Jack，\n\n小提醒一下，他們今天又更改了安全權限。104 號儲物櫃的新密碼是 5-7-9，不過我想你應該用不到。\n\nPaul.\n"
	"#str_delta4_gilbert_email_1_email_to"	"Jack Gilbert"
	"#str_delta4_gilbert_pda_fullname"	"Jack Gilbert"
	"#str_delta4_gilbert_pda_name"	"Jack Gilbert"
